<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/15/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Code is amended by substituting for section 306 the following section: “Abetment of suicide or attempted suicide 306. Whoever abets the commission of a suicide or an attempted suicide by any person, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to ten years, and shall also be liable to fine.”. Deletion of section 309"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/15/eng@> .
